Package: pedalboard-os
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Christof Laenzlinger <christof@laenzlinger.ch>
Installed-Size: 994
Depends: jackd2, adduser, systemd
Recommends: mod-host
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/pedalboard/pedalboard-os
Description: Pedalboard OS — systemd services and configuration for CM5
 Installs and manages all systemd units, systemd targets, udev rules,
 and runtime configuration for the pedalboard audio system running on
 a Compute Module 5.
 .
 Includes gig mode (pedalboard-gig.target) and studio mode
 (pedalboard-dev.target) for switching between minimal audio-only
 and full development stack at runtime.
